    "On the %@, open the **Playback** menu and choose **Wireless Communication**. If it offers Bluetooth pairing, skip it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur le %@, ouvrez le menu **Lecture** et choisissez **Communication sans fil**. S'il propose l'appairage Bluetooth, ignorez-le."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En la %@, abre el menú **Reproducción** y elige **Comunicación inalámbrica**. Si ofrece emparejar por Bluetooth, omítelo."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sulla %@, apri il menu **Riproduzione** e scegli **Comunicazione wireless**. Se propone l'abbinamento Bluetooth, saltalo."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffne an der %@ das Menü **Wiedergabe** und wähle **Drahtlose Kommunikation**. Bietet sie Bluetooth-Kopplung an, überspringe sie."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open op de %@ het menu **Weergave** en kies **Draadloze communicatie**. Als Bluetooth-koppeling wordt aangeboden, sla die over."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the %@, press **Playback**, then choose **Wireless Communication** (Wi-Fi button, or Menu → Connection Setting).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur le %@, appuyez sur **Lecture**, puis choisissez **Communication sans fil** (bouton Wi-Fi, ou Menu → Paramètres de connexion)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En la %@, pulsa **Reproducción** y elige **Comunicación inalámbrica** (botón Wi-Fi, o Menú → Ajustes de conexión)."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sulla %@, premi **Riproduzione**, poi scegli **Comunicazione wireless** (tasto Wi-Fi, oppure Menu → Impostazioni connessione)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drücke an der %@ **Wiedergabe** und wähle **Drahtlose Kommunikation** (WLAN-Taste oder Menü → Verbindungseinstellungen)."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Druk op de %@ op **Weergave** en kies **Draadloze communicatie** (wifiknop, of Menu → Verbindingsinstellingen)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the %@, press **Playback**, then the **Wi-Fi** button (on some models: Menu → **Wireless Communication**).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur le %@, appuyez sur **Lecture**, puis sur le bouton **Wi-Fi** (sur certains modèles : Menu → **Communication sans fil**)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En la %@, pulsa **Reproducción** y luego el botón **Wi-Fi** (en algunos modelos: Menú → **Comunicación inalámbrica**)."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sulla %@, premi **Riproduzione**, poi il tasto **Wi-Fi** (su alcuni modelli: Menu → **Comunicazione wireless**)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drücke an der %@ **Wiedergabe** und dann die **WLAN**-Taste (bei manchen Modellen: Menü → **Drahtlose Kommunikation**)."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Druk op de %@ op **Weergave** en dan op de **wifi**-knop (bij sommige modellen: Menu → **Draadloze communicatie**)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the camera, press **Playback**, then choose **Wireless Communication** (Wi-Fi button, or Menu → Connection Setting).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur l'appareil, appuyez sur **Lecture**, puis choisissez **Communication sans fil** (bouton Wi-Fi, ou Menu → Paramètres de connexion)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En la cámara, pulsa **Reproducción** y elige **Comunicación inalámbrica** (botón Wi-Fi, o Menú → Ajustes de conexión)."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sulla fotocamera, premi **Riproduzione**, poi scegli **Comunicazione wireless** (tasto Wi-Fi, oppure Menu → Impostazioni connessione)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drücke an der Kamera **Wiedergabe** und wähle **Drahtlose Kommunikation** (WLAN-Taste oder Menü → Verbindungseinstellungen)."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Druk op de camera op **Weergave** en kies **Draadloze communicatie** (wifiknop, of Menu → Verbindingsinstellingen)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On this Mac, join the camera's Wi-Fi network (named **FUJIFILM-X-…**).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur ce Mac, rejoignez le réseau Wi-Fi de l'appareil (nommé **FUJIFILM-X-…**)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En este Mac, conéctate a la red Wi-Fi de la cámara (llamada **FUJIFILM-X-…**)."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Su questo Mac, collegati alla rete Wi-Fi della fotocamera (chiamata **FUJIFILM-X-…**)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verbinde diesen Mac mit dem WLAN der Kamera (Name **FUJIFILM-X-…**)."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verbind deze Mac met het wifinetwerk van de camera (genaamd **FUJIFILM-X-…**)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
